---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ProboNewsletter from "../components/block/ProboNewsletter.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Probo Newsletter — upstream archive"
  description="Original Probo newsletter signup preserved from the upstream website."
  noIndex={true}
>
  <main class="container max-w-3xl py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mb-8 rounded-xl border bg-active p-5 sm:p-6">
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">Upstream Probo · preserved</p>
      <h1 class="text-h3 mb-3 font-medium">Original Probo newsletter</h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Formularul de mai jos este implementarea originală Probo și trimite abonarea către infrastructura Probo (<code>lists.probo.com</code>). Este păstrat separat ca funcție upstream; newsletter-ul ZebraByte folosește propriul endpoint și propria listă.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ProboNewsletter />
  </main>
</Layout>
